  - Must be backlog-free at registration
  - Maintenance CGPA/SGPA: 8.0 (both must not fall below simultaneously)
  - Minimum subjects: 6
  - Credit range: 18-24 lecture + 3-9 lab hours
  - Minimum minor GPA: 6.00
  - Additional credits required: at least 3 of the 6 subjects
  - B.Tech deadline: complete by 8th semester

MICRO-CREDIT:
  - Duration: 3-14 days
  - Max per semester: 2 courses
  - No supplementary exam
  - No grade revision
  - On failure: repeat when offered or take alternate

MICRO-SPECIALIZATION:
  - CGPA to register: >= 7.0
  - Maintenance: CGPA or SGPA >= 7.5
  - Total credits: 10-14
  - Minimum GPA: 6.00